OL,3,AHouthi missile hits Aramco building
OL,4,Aafter Saudi-led coalition hits Yemen
OL,5,Afuel depot
OL,6,
OL,7,FA missile launched by Yemen's Houthi
OL,8,Fmovement hit a building owned by Saudi
OL,9,FArabia's state oil company Aramco in
OL,10,Fthe eastern city of Dhahran overnight,
OL,11,Fafter a Saudi-led coalition struck a
OL,12,Ffuel depot near the Yemeni capital,
OL,13,FSanaa.
OL,15,FThe Saudi energy ministry said the
OL,16,FHouthi attack caused a "limited fire"
OL,17,Fin an administrative building at
OL,18,FAramco's headquarters.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
