OL,3,AHouthi missile hits Aramco building
OL,4,Aafter Saudi-led coalition hits Yemen
OL,5,Afuel depot
OL,6,
OL,7,FSaudi authorities reported that several
OL,8,Fmissiles and drones were intercepted
OL,9,Felsewhere, and that falling debris
OL,10,Finjured four people in the capital,
OL,11,FRiyadh.
OL,13,FThe Houthis said they targeted Aramco
OL,14,Fand Riyadh's airport in response to the
OL,15,Fcoalition's strike on the Yemen
OL,16,FPetroleum Company's al-Sabaha facility
OL,17,Fon Tuesday.
